# Two slots (DMN-07): the combo of any gamepad pauses every slot. Pad A
# has slot 0 and holds south (Space); Pad B has slot 1 and holds back+start,
# the function keys, which send nothing. B's combo fires at 2300 and pauses, which
# lets go of A's Space. While paused, A's tap of south maps nothing. B's
# combo again resumes at 5600, and then A's south holds Space again.
